     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ehi amico, ho un consiglio per te.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_TRYCE_04_P2_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I *trick ripetitivi* non danno molti punti. </text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_TRYCE_04_P3_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mischia *grind, trick al suolo, trick aerei*...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_TRYCE_04_P4_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>e *wallride* per fare acrobazie *originali*</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_TRYCE_04_P5_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>e accumulare un sacco di punti!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_VINYL_01_SUBJECT</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ci serve un medico</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_VINYL_01_P1_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Va&apos; a dare un&apos;occhiata al campo di basket.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_VINYL_01_P2_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Forse Prince non se n&apos;è ancora andato.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_VINYL_02_SUBJECT</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Franks avvistati</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_VINYL_02_P1_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ho visto un nuovo pezzo fantastico dei Franks.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_VINYL_02_P2_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>È in alto vicino alla stazione degli autobus a Brink Central.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_VINYL_02_P3_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Vedi se c&apos;è ancora qualcuno di loro in giro.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce103" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>// Chapter 5</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH5_COIL_01_SUBJECT</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Che si dice?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T4">EMAIL_CH5_COIL</text:span>_01_P1_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Sono io, Coil. Ci siamo conosciuti prima.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T4">EMAIL_CH5_COIL</text:span>_01_P2_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Devo controllare una cosa...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T4">EMAIL_CH5_COIL</text:span>_01_P3_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Sono *sull&apos;isola nel fiume Mataan*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T4">EMAIL_CH5_COIL</text:span>_01_P4_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ci vediamo lì</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH5_COIL_02_SUBJECT</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>A spasso per Mataan</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T4">EMAIL_CH5_COIL</text:span>_02_P1_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Come va? Sono di nuovo a Mataan</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T4">EMAIL_CH5_COIL</text:span>_02_P2_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hai presente *Toy Toy Town*?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T4">EMAIL_CH5_COIL</text:span>_02_P3_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Sono lì sul tetto</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T4">EMAIL_CH5_COIL</text:span>_02_P4_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Vicino agli elefanti, hai presente</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T4">EMAIL_CH5_COIL</text:span>_02_P5_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Raggiungimi, ho un&apos;idea</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH5_SOLACE_01_SUBJECT</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Aiuto?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH5__SOLACE_01_P1_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ehm... Se per caso stavi pensando di venirmi a salvare...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH5__SOLACE_01_P2_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Non sentirti obbligato, eh... ma nel caso...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH5__SOLACE_01_P3_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Quella grossa *bocca di leone*...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH5__SOLACE_01_P4_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>È un bel cantuccio stretto...!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH5__SOLACE_01_P5_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ma c&apos;è anche *un modo* per raggiungere il posto dove Faux mi sta portando...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH5__SOLACE_01_P6_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ehm... te lo dico solo nel caso... sai...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
